  "details": "I'd like to recommend a default weapon collision tag within the contact receiver. By having a standardized \"Weapon\" collision tag people it'll be much easier to setup fun pvp mechanics and systems like say a health system that goes down if you're struck with a weapon enough times. As it stands everyone will be acting blind and hoping others will be using the same term. What will likely happen is closed groups will decide their own specific terms like Arrow, Sword, Projectile, Atk, Wpn, etc.\nI look forward to the day where in a room an epic battle can erupt spontaneously for fun.",
